      "kind": "not-adopted",
      "issue": "https://github.com/zakstak/cliproxy-rs/issues/66",
      "evidence": "Go e48d780f (fix(plugin): preserve caller scope for replayed Claude OAuth MCP tool aliases) derives the Claude OAuth MCP alias secret from caller_scope metadata or session.CallerScope(api key) instead of the raw key (claude_executor_request.go resolveClaudeMCPAliasOptions). Executed pair: its parent b2fda98e sends mcp__poem_real__leisure_fixture_lookup (once in cloak-tools-beta, three times in each round trip); e48d780f sends mcp__drive_trade__cycle_fixture_lookup the same number of times.",
      "attribution": "Not adopted in this batch: tracker #66 decision, not a C1/C2 or plugin feature; cliproxy-rs keeps the frozen v8.0.35 behaviour. Executed v8.0.35 (ae3ee3be) on cloak-tools-beta, tool-roundtrip and tool-stream-roundtrip sends the same alias spelling the same number of times as cliproxy-rs and v8.0.10 (harness/evidence/attribution-20261112.json.gz)."
    },
    "claude-cloak-tool-alias-restore": {
      "kind": "not-adopted",
      "issue": "https://github.com/zakstak/cliproxy-rs/issues/66",
      "evidence": "Same Go e48d780f change: the scripted reply carries the v8.0.10 alias, which v8.0.67 no longer maps back. Executed pair: parent b2fda98e restores the caller's fixture_lookup once per round trip; e48d780f returns the scripted alias unchanged.",
